# The fuzzer in battle. Formation 1 from a new game (Rolf with the
# Knife, Nei with nothing), then 8000 ticks of fuzz: that fight, run
# from at tick 4231 after two rounds, the field, and a second fight.
#
# Before build 62 the fuzzer treated the battle's windows like any other
# menu -- random moves, then C or B -- and almost always took FIGHT, so
# every command stayed where loc_F550 / loc_F584 left it: Rolf on Attack,
# the unarmed Nei on Defend. Now it plays FIGHT/STGY, ORDR, the party
# and command triangles, the technique and item lists and the groups on
# purpose. With this seed the old one began no technique at all.

start battle 1
limit 6000
fuzz 8000 2
expect command attack
expect command tech
expect command item
expect command defend
expect no-stderr not ported
